  The agent uses a multi-tool system with automatic fallback:

  ┌─────────┐     ┌─────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐
  │  Aider  │ ──► │  Cline  │ ──► │  Custom Agent   │
  │ (1st)   │     │ (2nd)   │     │  (always works) │
  └─────────┘     └─────────┘     └─────────────────┘

  Tool Priority:
    1. Aider        — AI-powered coding assistant (pip install aider-chat)
    2. Cline        — Alternative CLI tool (npm install -g @anthropic-ai/cline)
    3. Custom Agent — Uses AI providers directly (always available)

  You can:
    • Use automatic fallback (default) — tries all tools until one works
    • Manually select a tool — forces execution with specific tool
    • Disable fallback — fails if selected tool is unavailable

